   "versionNonce": 1775524574,
   "isDeleted": false,
   "boundElements": null,
   "updated": 1,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "· Holds the Exotel WebSocket OPEN for the whole four-minute call\n· Streams 20 ms audio frames both ways, with barge-in\n· Receives Meta's WhatsApp webhooks\n· Runs @rc097/core — the same code as the phone and the edge function",
   "originalText": "· Holds the Exotel WebSocket OPEN for the whole four-minute call\n· Streams 20 ms audio frames both ways, with barge-in\n· Receives Meta's WhatsApp webhooks\n· Runs @rc097/core — the same code as the phone and the edge function",
   "fontSize": 13,
